<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-005-server-persisted-connections> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#consequences> "Persistence across devices; Argon2id password hashes." .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-005-server-persisted-connections> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#decisionId> "D-005" .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-005-server-persisted-connections> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#rationale> "VM connections live in SurrealDB connection table via /api/connections, scoped to the authenticated user. Plaintext passwords never stored." .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-005-server-persisted-connections> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#relatesTo> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Project> .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-005-server-persisted-connections> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#status> "accepted" .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-005-server-persisted-connections> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#title> "Saved connections are server-persisted" .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-006-gui-first-config> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision> .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-006-gui-first-config> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#alternatives> "CLI/env-first configuration" .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-006-gui-first-config> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#consequences> "Config intelligible to both humans and AI agents." .
