<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-006-gui-first-config> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#rationale> "Auth/connection/provider/Wazuh/TLS settings live in the web Settings UI backed by SurrealDB app_config. Env vars are bootstrap defaults only." .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-006-gui-first-config> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#relatesTo> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Project> .
