<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-007-https-acme-caddy-traefik> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#relatesTo> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Project> .
