<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-008-wazuh-external> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision> .
