<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-008-wazuh-external> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#relatesTo> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Project> .
