<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-010-in-app-chat-second-client> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#decisionId> "D-010" .
<https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#Decision-D-010-in-app-chat-second-client> <https://github.com/RyansOpenSourceRice/overlay-companion-mcp/onto#rationale> "The built-in chat panel streams an OpenRouter completion and executes a bounded tool allowlist against the C# /mcp endpoint. Not a new agent surface." .
